ROLE & PERMISSION MATRIX
========================

PUBLIC ACCESS (Guest)
---------------------
✓ View public pages (home, about, assemblies, why join)
✓ View public news, recognition, memoriam
✓ View public events & event details
✓ View officers, past GKs, directors
✓ View public programs (faith, family, community, youth, fraternal)
✓ View prayers & printable prayers
✓ Submit guest prayer request
✓ View photo galleries & newsletters
✓ View market center categories
✓ View job center
✓ View degree schedule

✗ Cannot log in
✗ Cannot access member or admin content
✗ Cannot volunteer
✗ Cannot vote
✗ Cannot upload anything


MEMBER
------
✓ All Guest permissions
✓ Login & access member dashboard
✓ View & edit own profile
✓ View member-only documents
✓ View member announcements
✓ View member calendar
✓ View member events
✓ Volunteer for events
✓ Submit volunteer hours
✓ View program committees
✓ View program details
✓ Volunteer for programs
✓ View member officers & directors
✓ View assemblies
✓ Access member market center
✓ View merchant reports (if merchant)
✓ Participate in voting
✓ View voting results (if allowed)

✗ Cannot modify public content
✗ Cannot modify events
✗ Cannot modify officers/directors
✗ Cannot modify programs
✗ Cannot upload media
✗ Cannot manage members
✗ Cannot access admin tools


