DEPUTY GRAND KNIGHT (DGK)
-------------------------
✓ All Member permissions
✓ All GK permissions EXCEPT:
  ✗ Cannot manage budget (Treasurer/GK only)
  ✗ Cannot manage dues (FS/GK only)
  ✗ Cannot modify webmaster settings

DGK is effectively GK-lite with limited financial & technical authority.


